  "_about": "Design tokens for the Group WorkStreams + Agile Sprints referral partner site ('Daylight', November 2026 redesign with the landing-page-design skill in .claude/skills). A light theme close to the official ZedX site: white pages, the official site's own tint (#F2F7FC) for the hero and panels, deep ink text, and one accent, a ZedX blue darkened from the official #0280CE until it passes AA as text and as a button (and kept under 80% saturation). All greys are one cool family. Type is Geist on the Tailwind scale, used only through the named text styles below. Spacing, radius and motion are the skill's Design Values. Check with: python3 .claude/skills/replica-design/contrast.py replica/design/tokens.json",
